BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 294.21 Tm (- The chiller COMPRESSOR only. Fans, chilled-water pumps, condenser pumps and cooling-tower fans keep) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 283.01 Tm (  running, and an airside economizer moves MORE air, so fan power can rise. The unmeasured term has the) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 271.81 Tm (  OPPOSITE SIGN, so this is an upper bound.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 258.93 Tm (- Code-minimum chiller efficiency is the OPTIMISTIC end: Standard 90.1 is a floor, hyperscale plants) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 247.73 Tm (  beat it, and a better chiller saves less per hour switched off.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 234.85 Tm (- Full-load kW/ton OVERSTATES the draw at the moment free cooling is available, because free cooling) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 223.65 Tm (  happens when it is cool and a chiller at a cool condenser runs below its rating. IPLV is the lower) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 212.45 Tm (  published number but is an annual-weighted metric under AHRI's assumed load profile, not the) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 201.25 Tm (  part-load point free-cooling weather sits at.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 188.37 Tm (- The heat rejected is APPROXIMATED by the IT load. UPS, PDU and lighting losses inside the envelope) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 177.17 Tm (  add to it; some overhead sits outside the cooled space, so scaling by full PUE would overshoot. No) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 165.97 Tm (  PUE multiplier is applied.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 153.09 Tm (- EIA STATE-SECTOR AVERAGES, not the site's tariff. A Loudoun County campus buys on a) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 141.89 Tm (  large-general-service contract that is not public.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 129.01 Tm (- No carbon, no water, no maintenance and no demand charges. Tower water use moves the OTHER way when) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 117.81 Tm (  the chiller runs less.) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 104.93 Tm (- Every caveat on the hours is inherited: the headline is conditional on the bank sitting on the long) Tj ET
BT /FR 8.20 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 93.73 Tm (  facade \(the refusal guard is priced at -3,124 h/yr where it fires\) and the unanchored row is) Tj ET
